10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ANJXKSyG184Q7kNvwFmK9qb&_nc_oc=Adol66Bl2E33jbryI4kYj7__UinCAuRw7F_KhtNsf_LgY_fQzfZhpdrLQ_bRp8r_ww8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0yB39xbIwoTJOmRCmy9Dba6naacawXH__Fk33KMxKF5Q&oe=69D3C24C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iaPothsBzNkQ7kNvwH7DQOy&_nc_oc=AdpBjMvNmrkzQY5oZkQvd_Fj8qUJlptjOYpLObfsc3atvqtg6gAQCnpVz02VYHabECM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0G4JwekdCsY6ERVHYpTzPfJwAZEwAUqxt2D2eMbhrpGA&oe=69D39AFC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ykENJvHIlbUQ7kNvwH1sB-M&_nc_oc=AdoKLhKqi-LBfRz6XHpZDDBqMPKzXvYCpUpi5HXpAyE2r8Pu3S8lnIPudQ3kR9yJgsk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0r2uUolznV5Q0SrNCLls7t43lbQrvdyP7f_HySy-q6CQ&oe=69D3B22B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore